- **Response-propensity belief and safe probing — prior art; India-specific modes PLANNED.** Kruse, LeTS-Drive and ego-conditioned planning already cover the mechanisms. [P3 prior-art review](/Users/aditya/dev/sih2026-hq/research/P3-PLANNER.md)
