- **Composable closed-loop benchmark and failure-to-regression loop — prior-art methods applied to Indian scenes, PLANNED.** ARAI and Safety Pool already collect Indian scenarios; claim no “first.” [P1 competitor check](/Users/aditya/dev/sih2026-hq/research/P1-DIFFICULTY-CATALOGUE.md)
